OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy start in the west with
OL,6,Fshowers along the northern coasts of
OL,7,FDevon and Cornwall, moving inland
OL,8,Flater. Brighter further east with
OL,9,Flight showers in the afternoon. Winds
OL,10,Flighter than of late but feeling cool
OL,11,Fin places.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FShowers easing overnight as
OL,14,Fcloud breaks, bringing some clearer
OL,15,Fspells in places. Winds turning very
OL,16,Flight which can lead to mist and fog,
OL,17,Fmostly in the east.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
