OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FEarly mist and fog will lift
OL,6,Finto patchy cloud initially. Some
OL,7,Fbrighter spells develop in the
OL,8,Fafternoon with light winds.
OL,9,FTemperatures around average for the
OL,10,Fend of October.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FStaying
OL,13,Fsettled for the rest of the week as
OL,14,Fhigh pressure stays in charge in the
OL,15,Fsouth. Light winds will lead to mist
OL,16,Fand fog overnight and during the
OL,17,Fmornings.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
